<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Spray of Acid</h1>
<p>Sphere: Acid Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 120)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast spray of acid &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast spray of acid</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster points a finger at the target and hisses 'Oses causter', and a 
spray of acid shoots from the fingertip. The better your magic and your 
acid sphere, the more it burns. Acid eats through armour: it hurts nearly 
as much through plate as through clothes. A shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Acid Drop</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Acid Ball</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Acid Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Acid Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>